From: Custom TLS Fingerprint <noreply@example.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] net/ssl: add TLSFingerprintConfig source files to BUILD.gn

Adds net/ssl/tls_fingerprint_config.{h,cc} to the net/ssl BUILD target so
they are compiled as part of the net component.

Apply after copying src/chromium/net/ssl/tls_fingerprint_config.{h,cc}
into the Chromium source tree at net/ssl/.
---
 net/ssl/BUILD.gn | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/net/ssl/BUILD.gn b/net/ssl/BUILD.gn
index abc12345..def67890 100644
--- a/net/ssl/BUILD.gn
+++ b/net/ssl/BUILD.gn
@@ -30,6 +30,12 @@ component("ssl") {
   sources = [
     "client_cert_identity.cc",
     "client_cert_identity.h",
+    # Custom TLS fingerprint spoofing support
+    "tls_fingerprint_config.cc",
+    "tls_fingerprint_config.h",
     "openssl_private_key.cc",
     "openssl_private_key.h",
     "ssl_cert_request_info.cc",
